1- Application Layer
2- Presentation Layer

  Determines what data should be presented as, what is the format, etc.

3- Session Layer

  A session is stablished between the client and the server

4- Transport Layer

  We determine what protocol is being used to transfer the data that is either TCP or UDP protocol.

5- Network Layer

  We are going to have the IP address and all the networking.

6- Data Link Layer

  Establishes the connectionbetween two systems using the Mac address.

7- Physical Layer

  Converts this data into binary zero and ones. That is how the data travels.
